/-!
# Filtrations of a quasi-compact algebraic space by scheme strata

A quasi-compact algebraic space admits a descending filtration by open subspaces
whose reduced strata have separated scheme étale neighborhoods that are
isomorphisms over the strata; in particular those strata are schemes.

The development is split into the files
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Decent.FiniteSchemeFiltration.FiberPower`,
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Decent.FiniteSchemeFiltration.ActionGroupoid`,
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Decent.FiniteSchemeFiltration.ActionRelationDescent`,
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Decent.FiniteSchemeFiltration.DegreeFiltration`,
`StacksFrontier.AlgebraicGeometry.Spaces.Decent.FiniteSchemeFiltration.Strata`.
-/
